  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eng 403.02 Continuing Professional Development Requirements for New Licensees. New licensees shall be exempt from obtaining professional development hours for their first biennial renewal period.\n\nSource. #6911, eff 12-15-98; ss by #8190, eff 10-19-04; ss by #10045, eff 1-1-12, EXPIRED: 1-1-22\n\nNew. #13859, eff 3-26-24",
